message: "If you use this research or its computational materials, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Insulin Resistance and Systemic Inflammation Below the HbA1c Prediabetes Threshold: Age-Dependent Associations in U.S. Adults, NHANES 2015–March 2020"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Moerschbacher"
    given-names: "Scott"
    affiliation: "Open Inquiry Research Group"

  - family-names: "Baker"
    given-names: "Janice"
    affiliation: "Open Inquiry Research Group; Department of Sociology, University of Nevada, Reno"

abstract: >-
  Reproducible computational materials and manuscript for a survey-weighted
  analysis of the association between HOMA-IR and high-sensitivity C-reactive
  protein among U.S. adults without diagnosed diabetes and with HbA1c below
  5.7%, using NHANES 2015–March 2020 data. The study evaluates modification
  of the adjusted HOMA-IR–hs-CRP association across adulthood.

keywords:
  - "NHANES"
  - "HOMA-IR"
